<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Dense Coordinate-List Fine-Tuning Induces a Controllable Interference Surface in Vision-Language Models</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Chenyu Zhou
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
<span class="ltx_contact ltx_role_affiliation"><span class="ltx_contact_name">Affiliation: </span>School of Engineering, Institute of Science Tokyo, Japan
</span>
<span class="ltx_contact ltx_role_email"><span class="ltx_contact_name">E-mail </span><a href="mailto:zhou.c.76d6@m.isct.ac.jp">zhou.c.76d6@m.isct.ac.jp</a>
